easoning to prove it!<br><br>Will Yeonwoo be able to find out who she actually kissed, and will that get her to the ending she wants?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Features]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactive Movie: Stories and endings that are clearly reflected through choices.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Algorithm: Kissing different characters, making each play-through different.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Minigames: Colorful mini-games that are naturally integrated with the story.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solving the mystery: All the clues collected with your clicks go into the diary! Collect achievements and lookbook pieces.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skip Function: Skip the scenes and mini-games (from the second playthrough)!</li></ul>",
